ve them with as much  equipment as possible  it's my objective to make ensure that  the afghan security forces  are in the best possible security  posture and that means  transitioning bases and equipment to the  afghan security forces more than 10  000 u.s and coalition troops need to  leave afghanistan within five months  as numbers dwindle the pentagon has sent  two b-52 bombers to qatar  and will keep an aircraft carrier in the  region as cover  in case of taliban aggression charlotte  bellis al jazeera
 

